    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720450/extras/287c4b052fda1569c204f681f0a3e3c9.avif?t=1752253421\" width=616 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Trial is a story-driven adventure mixed with action and puzzles. Meet quirky characters, fight intense and engaging battles and discover the terrific secrets of the kingdom and it's heroes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kitt and Murray are old friends who do everything together. They study, walk and watch each other's backs in any situation. But the situation they will find themselves in this time will require <i><u>your</u></i> help!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the kingdom and its surroundings in search of answers!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve puzzles that require atypical thinking!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet or fight with a wide variety of bright and unusual characters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use only the best equipment!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only then you will have a chance to solve the mystery that your home kingdom has been hiding for many years.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720450/extras/6e1dacfb96c26d23b9efc1703fb3aa68.avif?t=1752253421\" width=616 height=400 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720450/extras/287c4b052fda1569c204f681f0a3e3c9.avif?t=1752253421\" width=616 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Trial is a story-driven adventure mixed with action and puzzles. Meet quirky characters, fight intense and engaging battles and discover the terrific secrets of the kingdom and it's heroes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kitt and Murray are old friends who do everything together. They study, walk and watch each other's backs in any situation. But the situation they will find themselves in this time will require <i><u>your</u></i> help!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the kingdom and its surroundings in search of answers!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve puzzles that require atypical thinking!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet or fight with a wide variety of bright and unusual characters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use only the best equipment!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only then you will have a chance to solve the mystery that your home kingdom has been hiding for many years.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720450/extras/6e1dacfb96c26d23b9efc1703fb3aa68.avif?t=1752253421\" width=616 height=400 /></span></p>",
